      <h2 id="tos-sms">6. SMS Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>

      <h3>6.1 SMS Program Overview</h3>
      <p>dub offers an optional SMS messaging program to provide you with convenient updates and information about your account, competitions, and orders. By opting in to receive SMS messages from dub, you agree to these SMS Terms &amp; Conditions.</p>

      <h3>6.2 SMS Consent Communication</h3>
      <p><strong>Your Privacy is Protected:</strong></p>
      <p>The information (phone numbers) obtained as part of the SMS consent process will <strong>NOT</strong> be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing purposes. Your phone number will only be used by dub to communicate with you directly regarding your account, competitions, orders, and services.</p>

      <h3>6.3 Types of SMS Communications</h3>
      <p>If you have consented to receive text messages from dub, you may receive messages related to the following:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Competition Updates:</strong> Notifications about tournaments, pick deadlines, results, and leaderboard changes</li>
        <li><strong>Order Updates:</strong> Confirmation of merchandise orders and status updates on production and shipping</li>
        <li><strong>Account Notifications:</strong> Important updates about your account, points balance, and rewards</li>
        <li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Responses to your questions and support requests</li>
        <li><strong>Promotions or Offers:</strong> Special deals, discounts, and promotional offers (only if you've opted in)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>6.4 Message Frequency</h3>
      <p>Message frequency may vary depending on the type of communication and your level of engagement with our services.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>You may receive up to <strong>4 SMS messages per week</strong> related to your account, competitions, or order status</li>
        <li>During active tournament periods, you may receive more frequent updates</li>
        <li>Promotional messages (if opted in) are sent no more than 2 times per week</li>
        <li>Urgent updates or time-sensitive notifications may be sent as needed</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>6.5 Potential Fees for SMS Messaging</h3>
      <p><strong>Important Cost Information:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Standard message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile carrier's pricing plan</li>
        <li>These fees may vary if the message is sent domestically or internationally</li>
        <li>dub does not charge any fees for receiving text messages, but your carrier may</li>
        <li>Check with your mobile carrier for details about your messaging plan and any applicable charges</li>
        <li>Message and data rates are determined by your carrier and are not controlled by dub</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>6.6 Opt-In Methods</h3>
      <p>You may opt in to receive SMS messages from dub in the following ways:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Online Form:</strong> By checking the SMS consent box on our website or app and providing your phone number</li>
        <li><strong>During Registration:</strong> By providing consent during the account creation process</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Voluntary Participation:</strong> Opting in to SMS communications is completely voluntary. You are not required to consent to receive text messages to use our services. However, opting in allows you to receive convenient updates and important information about your competitions and orders.</p>

      <h3>6.7 Opt-Out Methods</h3>
      <p><strong>You can opt out of receiving SMS messages at any time.</strong> We respect your communication preferences and make it easy to unsubscribe:</p>
      <h4>Primary Opt-Out Method:</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Reply "STOP":</strong> Simply reply with the word "STOP" to any SMS message you receive from dub. You will receive a confirmation message that you have been unsubscribed.</li>
      </ul>
      <h4>Alternative Opt-Out Methods:</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email Request:</strong> Send an email to <a href="mailto:support@getdub.com">support@getdub.com</a> requesting to opt out of SMS messages</li>
        <li><strong>In-App Settings:</strong> Manage your notification preferences in your dub account settings</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Important:</strong> After opting out, you will no longer receive SMS messages from dub. However, you may still receive critical transactional messages related to active orders until those orders are completed.</p>

      <h3>6.8 Help and Support</h3>
      <p>If you are experiencing any issues with our SMS program or need assistance:</p>
      <h4>Get Help via Text:</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Reply "HELP":</strong> Reply with the word "HELP" to any SMS message from dub to receive assistance information</li>
      </ul>
      <h4>Direct Support:</h4>
